==The Draft==
{{#ev:youtube|HaeunHZ3SuM|280}}

==Format==
* Games will be played on european servers. 
* {{abbr|BO3|Best of 3}} maps; first to win 2 maps wins. You get 1 point for a map win.
<br />
Originally intended to have playoffs only upon player agreement at the end of the standard schedule, due to player demand in the second round the tournament was modified to have a definite two round, BO5 playoff between the top 4, in divisions 1 and 2.  Division 1 playoff will be held on Sunday the 2nd of June, and Division 2 on Sunday the 9th of the same month.

